        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "We bought our shower door here; they didn’t have it in stock when we were there, so they back ordered it for us. The shower door arrived exactly on time on the date that they told us it would arrived. Super happy with our purchase. We also got our toilet paper stand here; they have all types of floor models, see it in person and we are happy to find ours with reasonable price. A wonderful and comfortable store to shop with friendly services",
