        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "My husband and I had a wonderful experience at Bath Depot! The staff was incredibly nice and welcoming from the moment we arrived. They were so helpful, patient, and really took the time to answer all our questions. You can tell they work well as a team—they made the whole process smooth and enjoyable. We truly appreciated their kindness and professionalism. I will definitely recommend Bath Depot to my friends and anyone looking for great service and quality products. Thank you again for everything!",
